Are you an experienced Account Manager with a strong understanding of the German market? We are looking for a German-speaking Key Account Manager to manage and further develop their most important B2B accounts in Germany. You’ll have your own portfolio, significant commercial responsibility and the freedom to determine how you grow your accounts.
- Manage and grow a portfolio of key German B2B accounts;
- Develop account plans with clear revenue and growth targets;
- Negotiate annual agreements, pricing and commercial terms while protecting margins;
- Build strong relationships with purchasing, category management and decision-makers;
- Identify cross-selling and upselling opportunities;
- Introduce new products and product lines to your accounts;
- Identify and acquire new clients with key-account potential;
- Regularly visit clients and attend trade fairs in Germany;
- Translate market and customer insights into commercial opportunities;
- Work closely with sales support, purchasing and logistics.

You’ll also act as an important link between the German market and the internal commercial team, providing insights that can influence product range, pricing and the German B2B webshop.RequirementsWho are you?- Fluent in German, including professional-level negotiation skills;
- Good command of English and/or Dutch;
- At least 5 years of experience in Account Management or Key Account Management;
- Experience in B2B, distribution, retail or e-commerce is preferred;
- Strong negotiation and relationship-management skills;
- Commercially driven and focused on long-term account development;
- Able to work independently and take ownership of your targets;
- Willing to travel regularly to Germany for client visits and trade fairs;
- A relevant network within the German reseller or retail market is a plus.

Benefits- Performance-based bonus of up to 50% of the monthly salary;
- 26 vacation days with the option to purchase 5 additional days;
- 8% holiday allowance;
- Full

Wolfram Chain is looking for a motivated Class C truck driver for a transport company that supplies catering and hospitality businesses, based in Berkel en Rodenrijs.You will work closely with a direct colleague, get to know many regular customers, and at the end of the day, you can enjoy a hot meal at the office for a small fee.Ready for a new challenge? Check out this vacancy or get in touch with us!

